# Consolidated engineering ledger, the single source of truth for open defects.
# Local only: it lists unfixed security findings, and this repo is public.
# Remove this line once the P0 security items in it are fixed, if you want it public.
SSOT.md

# Desktop: leftover downloaded player natives from before the KitePlayer-only desktop build.
# Nothing produces this any more; the entry stays so an old local copy can never be committed.
desktopApp/resources/

# KiteConfig plugin state: takeover-recovery backups and lock files are local
# machine state, regenerated by the kite* tasks; never code or assets.
# KiteConfig ownership receipts are committed on purpose: they record which
# generated files the plugin owns, so a fresh clone can prove it. Recovery
# backups are local safety copies and stay out.
.kiteconfig/recovery/
**/.kiteconfig/**/*.lock
*.kiteconfig.bak
